@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Drawing, Drag & Drop, Slider and Mouse up/down/mouse over - RPA Demo Page";
}

<div id="content">
    <!--  CONTENT   -->
    <div id="page-header" class="page-demo">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="span12 whitebg">
                <h1>Demo <span>Drawing</span> with <em>Ui.Vision RPA</em> XClick and XMove</h1>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">


        <div class="span12">

            <p>
                In a second the DemoXClick macro will click <a href="https://sketch.io/sketchpad/">this link</a>,
                which will bring you to the external Sketchpad website. Once there, the <em>Ui.Vision RPA software</em> will
                use the <a href="n/rpa/docs/xclick">Computer-Vision XClick and XType commands</a> to automate the web app. It will draw a square on the canvas, verify it and type some text.
            </p>

            <p>The DemoXMove macro is using <a href="https://ionicframework.com/docs/v3/demos/src/range/www/?production=true&ionicplatform=ios">this external website</a>
            to show how to use XMove to move sliders. It also shows how to select e. g. the 3rd match from a list of found image matches.
            </p>
            
            <p>The DemoXClickTextRelative macro uses this external <a href="https://www.theonlinecalculator.com/">calculator</a> website
            to show how to use text/OCR as anchor.
            </p>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>
